CORE gcc-only
compatibility.c

^EXIT=0$
^SIGNAL=0$
--
^warning: ignoring
^CONVERSION ERROR$
--
Generic selection uses type compatibility after lvalue conversion: _Atomic is
removed, _Noreturn and parameter qualifiers do not affect function types,
ellipsis does, VLAs are compatible with any array size, and wchar_t literals
match the wchar_t typedef.
